          七折优惠券：weifeng90
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-zinc-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-zinc-800 shadow-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden">
